WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.940
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:09.639
Today I am going to explain an American independent
science fiction film called “Embers.”

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:11.080
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:17.390
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:23.009
In the near future, a strange virus spreads
around the world causing people to get retrograde

00:00:23.009 --> 00:00:24.849
and anterograde amnesia.

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:29.609
It spreads like wildfire and takes over the
world in no time.

00:00:29.609 --> 00:00:32.890
All developments halt as a result of the epidemic.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:37.370
Some wealthy and powerful individuals of the
society prevent themselves from getting the

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.730
virus by hiding in bunkers.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:44.420
A decade after it has destroyed the world,
only a few people survive.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:50.180
They live in a decaying landscape, unable
to recall the past or create new memories.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.960
Every day they wake up to a new life and don’t
remember anything about themselves.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:58.390
In the opening scene, we are introduced to
a man and a woman.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:01.429
They wake up next to each other in a rustic
apartment.

00:01:01.429 --> 00:01:03.949
Both of them are confused as to how they ended
up together.

00:01:03.949 --> 00:01:08.220
They don’t even remember their names or
anything about their lives.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.330
It is evident that they have been infected
by the virus.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:14.940
The two seem calm for people who just woke
up next to a stranger.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.640
The woman feels like she knows the man but
doesn’t remember how.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.890
The man claims he feels the same way.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.670
They discuss how long they might have been
in the apartment but come to the conclusion

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:28.610
that it might be their first day.

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:34.680
Then, the man notices similar blue bracelets
tied to their wrists.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:39.390
He thinks it indicates that before they lost
their memories, they wanted to be together.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:43.890
The woman agrees and doesn’t question the
stranger since he feels familiar.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:49.080
Somewhere else in the town, an abandoned kid
runs around the street mumbling a melody.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.310
He meets a stranger who asks him questions
about his parents.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:02:02.380
When the child doesn’t answer, the man simply
invites him to join him in his journey.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.170
They continue walking to no particular destination.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:08.880
The boy wants to play with the man’s watch,
so he hands it to him.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:13.069
He tries to explain the concept of time to
the kid but fails miserably.

00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:18.030
A while later, the boy gets distracted by
a mirror on the pile of garbage by the side

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.030
of the road.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:23.799
The stranger walks away talking to himself
about time and space, not noticing that the

00:02:23.799 --> 00:02:25.810
kid is no longer with him.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:30.780
Some seconds later, the kid runs to him but
by the time, the man has already forgotten

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:31.780
him.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:34.890
He introduces himself again and asks the kid
about the watch.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:39.329
He comments that it is too big for the kid
and wears it himself, not remembering that

00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:41.799
he gave it to the boy a few moments ago.

00:02:41.799 --> 00:02:46.860
Eventually, they reach the remains of a house
where the man dances with an umbrella to entertain

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:47.990
the kid.

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:52.609
Somewhere else, in a fancy bunker, a young
woman named Miranda does her early morning

00:02:52.609 --> 00:02:56.299
routine that has been the same for as long
as she can remember.

00:02:56.299 --> 00:03:01.409
A computerized program asks her to introduce
herself for a regular checkup to ensure she

00:03:01.409 --> 00:03:03.239
hasn’t gotten the virus.

00:03:03.239 --> 00:03:06.980
The computer asks her name, her birthplace,
and her birth date.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.469
It is revealed that Miranda has been in confinement
for the past nine years.

00:03:11.469 --> 00:03:14.540
She is then told a scenario and asked questions
about it.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:18.560
When she answers all of them correctly, the
computer declares she has passed the regular

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.750
diagnostics.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.569
The likelihood of her being infected is less
than 0.12%.

00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:29.489
Although Miranda is in the safest place one
can be during an epidemic, she is not happy

00:03:29.489 --> 00:03:30.650
with her life.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:35.159
The routine she has been following for the
past nine years bores her to death and she

00:03:35.159 --> 00:03:39.989
feels like life outside would be much more
enjoyable even if it is dangerous.

00:03:39.989 --> 00:03:44.540
Another man who has been infected by the virus
is a teacher who lives in a secluded house

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.879
near the woods.

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:50.099
He has adapted to life as an amnesic person
better than other infected people.

00:03:50.099 --> 00:03:54.269
He has maintained a journal that helps him
understand why he doesn’t remember anything.

00:03:54.269 --> 00:03:58.409
He also leaves himself notes briefing about
the daily activities he should perform.

00:03:58.409 --> 00:04:03.370
A rope is tied from his house to a nearby
river to help him navigate the way when he

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.180
goes out to fetch water.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:09.549
Back in the apartment with the couple, the
woman finds a can of preserved fruits in a

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:10.549
cabinet.

00:04:10.549 --> 00:04:18.130
They might have left it there the previous
day but they aren’t sure.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:22.760
She tries the food and gives it to the guy
after making sure it tastes good.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:27.000
While eating she tucks her hair behind her
ears and the man excitedly claims that he

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.850
knew she was about to tuck it.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:32.720
Although he doesn’t know anything about
himself, he somehow remembers the little things

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:34.200
that the woman does.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:38.230
She walks up to the mirror and looks at herself,
taking in her appearance.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:41.290
They discuss the possibility of them being
relatives.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:45.910
But since they look different from each other,
they cut the possibility of them being siblings.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.120
The woman assumes they are married and the
man smiles at the idea.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.030
To test it, they kiss each other.

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:59.290
The passion while they kiss makes it clear
to them that they are in fact a couple.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:04.070
In the following scene, we are introduced
to a thug who after being infected, has been

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.540
killing and robbing people for food and supplies.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.440
He notices the little kid and his new mentor
from earlier.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.730
They are sitting down eating a canned drink.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.160
The thug attacks the man and kills him for
the drink.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:20.820
The kid is left alone but he doesn’t express
sadness on his mentor’s death.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.510
He simply takes the watch off the man’s
wrist and walks away.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:29.430
Back in the woods, the teacher reads the notes
and cooks food according to the instructions.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:34.840
While lounging, he discovers a book on his
desk that he had written before the pandemic.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:38.660
In the meantime, the couple from the apartment
talks about their relationship.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:42.320
They think of a name for each other and decide
to go with Ben and Jenny.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.870
They are falling in love for the hundredth
time like they have done every day for the

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:48.250
past decade.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:52.100
Ben suggests they check who else is in the
building to get a better understanding of

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.240
where they are.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:58.050
They walk out and see the building consists
of rooms similar to theirs.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:02.390
After exploring one of them, they decide to
return to their room but have forgotten where

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.390
it is.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.530
They enter a random room but Ben suggests
that they should find themselves something

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:10.310
better than the dusty rooms of an abandoned
building.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.990
Hence, they pack the clothes from the closet
and start their journey outside.

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:19.130
Back in the bunker, Miranda is exercising
with her father like usual.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.120
He is the only other resident of the facility.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.770
While eating a pre-packed dinner, they talk
about their day.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:29.220
It is revealed that Miranda plays the cello
to keep her busy throughout the day.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:33.710
Her father knows that Miranda isn’t happy
with her life in the bunker but his first

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:38.740
responsibility is to keep her safe so he cannot
allow her to go outside.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:42.430
The little kid from earlier is now wandering
around the town alone.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.860
He meets a young girl in front of her house.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:50.810
She invites him in and asks him to stay with
her forever.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:56.370
They eat good food and play with her stuffed
toys.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:07:00.230
In the following scene, Ben and Jenny reach
an empty swimming pool.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:04.900
Ben watches his wife with a smile as she plays
on the slide and skips around.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.600
The thug from earlier is also lonely.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:12.130
He plays alone in a kid’s park until he
sees a woman and chases her.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:16.930
After a struggle, she manages to get away
and he gets distracted by a horse and forgets

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.280
what he was doing.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:22.590
At the same time, Ben and Jenny walk together
while humming a song.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.620
They have forgotten the purpose of the trip.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.900
They enter a chapel that they think is oddly
familiar.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:31.720
After spending some time there, they go to
a room and make love.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:35.710
At night, they sit in front of the fire talking
about several things.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:40.560
They quickly register that the next day, they
will be strangers again, hence they shouldn’t

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.580
fall asleep to remember they love each other.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.920
The following morning, the kid wakes up on
a pile of toys.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:51.240
He doesn’t remember how he got there, so
he escapes through the window.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.540
While roaming around the woods, he meets the
teacher and follows him home.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:08:00.790
The teacher is not happy about his presence
at first but opens up to the boy with time.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:05.510
He feeds the kid good food and teaches him
how to chop wood claiming that he is an expert

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:08.640
in the task but doesn’t know how he learned
it.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:12.350
Ben and Jenny, on the other hand, have eventually
fallen asleep.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:14.360
They wake up as strangers yet again.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:18.360
They repeat the conversation from the previous
day and get along.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:21.120
Moments later, they are roaming around town
while talking.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.080
This time, they name each other Max and Katie.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:27.420
Katie hurts her leg making it bleed profusely.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:31.590
Max quickly runs away to get some water for
her, asking her to wait for him.

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:35.969
He gets a bottle of water but doesn’t remember
why he was looking for it in the first place.

00:08:35.969 --> 00:08:40.890
He drinks it and walks the other way while
Katie still waits for him to return.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:46.459
Somewhere else, the thug is in a parking lot,
breaking cars out of anger and for entertainment.

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:50.380
After he is tired, he gets inside one of them
and falls asleep.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.810
He is woken up by a gang of men who drag him
out of the car and beat him up.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.080
Some minutes later, they leave him alone.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.720
The thug walks to the terrace while sobbing.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.920
He sees a person in the street below and starts
throwing glass bottles at them, completely

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:07.550
forgetting what he was crying about a few
seconds earlier.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.519
In the bunker, boredom gets the best of Miranda.

00:09:10.519 --> 00:09:12.790
Playing cello doesn’t excite her anymore.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:16.509
She braids her hair to keep herself entertained
but that doesn’t work either.

00:09:16.509 --> 00:09:20.620
At dinner, she suggests they get out of the
bunker to check if the world has gone back

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.620
to normal.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:26.050
Her father argues that they would have gotten
a message long ago if that were the case.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:30.891
He is adamant about living safely for as long
as it takes but according to Miranda, they

00:09:30.891 --> 00:09:33.759
are only waiting for their inevitable death.

00:09:33.759 --> 00:09:37.839
When Max doesn’t return for a long time,
Katie forgets who she was waiting for.

00:09:37.839 --> 00:09:40.959
She walks away and spends the night under
a bridge.

00:09:40.959 --> 00:09:45.490
She is alone, cold, and misses something but
doesn’t know what.

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:48.230
Meanwhile, the teacher and the kid get along
well.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.910
He teaches the kid to ride a bicycle and has
become his guardian.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:56.300
To ensure that he doesn’t run away and forget
his way back home, he ties him to a roll of

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.699
wool and lets him play in the woods.

00:09:58.699 --> 00:10:02.800
The kid plays around the entire day but returns
home in the end.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:06.980
In the bunker, Miranda plays cello for her
father for the first time.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.240
She asks him to come outside with her but
he doesn’t agree.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.740
When the computerized voice takes Miranda’s
test the next day, she deliberately answers

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.740
incorrectly.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:21.290
At night, she packs up her belongings, determined
to leave the bunker and live a life of her

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.490
own accord.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:26.939
She leaves her father a note saying goodbye
and enters the exit tunnels.

00:10:26.939 --> 00:10:31.500
After getting lost for a little while, she
finally reaches the outside world and smiles,

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.079
taking in the beauty of nature.

00:10:34.079 --> 00:10:39.029
Moments later, she walks off into the distance,
living her life for the first time.

00:10:39.029 --> 00:10:42.630
Back in the town, Katie is living off the
food she finds in the garbage.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:47.069
It begins to thunder so she takes shelter
nearby where a guy with a similar bracelet

00:10:47.069 --> 00:10:48.390
stands by her.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:50.370
The guy turns out to be Max.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:55.339
The movie ends as they stare at each other,
almost as if they remember their past together.

00:10:55.339 --> 00:10:59.809
